{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "04WA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{D} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$u : \\mathcal{C} \\to \\mathcal{D}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$f^{-1}\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0006": "$u_p\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{D}$", "MATH_0008": "$f^{-1}\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0010": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-proposition-get-morphism}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-pullback-stack}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:136f69b8ed0f3ce319fe16cba29e990c1b07a6069582cec61afeb488fc9dbff5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9a9b62eb7ae00b633fd56664f5f9f5c9db4aaee63dc30aa0d3cf5d62de948e21", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of sites\ngiven by a continuous functor <MATH_0002>\nsatisfying the hypotheses and conclusions of\nSites, Proposition <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a stack over <MATH_0004>.\nIn this setting we write <TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0005><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> for the stackification\nof the fibred category <MATH_0006> over <MATH_0007> constructed\nabove. We say that <MATH_0008> is the\n<TEXTITOPEN_0002>pullback of <MATH_0009> along <MATH_0010><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1dc10f78afbe32e1791e99aa96e2ace57af00bb57c4ecfb7b283d6a54b6891fb", "unit_id": "tag:04WJ:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04WA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0002": "$f^{-1}\\mathcal{S}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-stackify-groupoids}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-fibred-groupoids-category-pullback}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0e8478080fdfef4a5a7213af96fc8b3bd7e7124de69096ee3cbfc2399778921b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:742f00412e4ed29fe4f2a0bd0a4e87aa9790f52837a5057bd08a45d014ea27e3", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nOf course, if <MATH_0001> is a stack in groupoids, then <MATH_0002>\nis a stack in groupoids by\nLemmas <REF_0001> and\n<REF_0002>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:19b99041f6865d0a2aafe4fef2b9677e042060b673608313d21de7ff65b24ef5", "unit_id": "tag:04WA:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04WA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{D} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$u : \\mathcal{C} \\to \\mathcal{D}$", "MATH_0003": "$p : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$q : \\mathcal{T} \\to \\mathcal{D}$", "MATH_0005": "$$\n\\Mor_{\\textit{Stacks}/\\mathcal{C}}(\\mathcal{S}, f_*\\mathcal{T})\n=\n\\Mor_{\\textit{Stacks}/\\mathcal{D}}(f^{-1}\\mathcal{S}, \\mathcal{T})\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-proposition-get-morphism}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-adjointness-pullback-pushforward-stacks}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2474790bd3dac93602e2b0a295a9dd2e2ecb55aff243c005ae01499e5df1c001", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bdb3e8ad1528f10bfaf9a2619c4d7dd84dcfb5a226cb73f64deaeb8ece22215a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of sites\ngiven by a continuous functor <MATH_0002>\nsatisfying the hypotheses and conclusions of\nSites, Proposition <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0003> and\n<MATH_0004> be stacks.\nThen we have a canonical equivalence of categories\n<MATH_0005>\nof morphism categories.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:db68e118a9e15849a7e1a9d8277807b3329e53b6e91fa63b07cd01ba3878212b", "unit_id": "tag:04WK:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04WA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$i = 1, 2$", "MATH_0002": "$i$", "MATH_0003": "$i$", "MATH_0004": "$$\n\\Mor_{\\textit{Fib}/\\mathcal{C}}(\\mathcal{S}, u^p\\mathcal{T})\n=\n\\Mor_{\\textit{Fib}/\\mathcal{D}}(u_p\\mathcal{S}, \\mathcal{T})\n$$", "MATH_0005": "$u^p\\mathcal{T} = f_*\\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0006": "$f^{-1}\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0007": "$u_p\\mathcal{S}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-stacks-over-C}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-adjointness-pullback-pushforward}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-stackify-universal-property-more}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c2c911ad265a80282d2ffbc54d22e0d38efb28369aedbc409ca8b2d3ac958705", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:aa06d3a9d0cb538b439d3d2de57614fd05fe1c868cf9763e952ef556e8f7f3ba", "source_text": "For <MATH_0001> an <MATH_0002>-morphism of stacks is the same thing as a\n<MATH_0003>-morphism of fibred categories, see\nDefinition <REF_0001>.\nBy\nLemma <REF_0002>\nwe have already\n<MATH_0004>\nHence the result follows from\nLemma <REF_0003>\nas <MATH_0005> and <MATH_0006> is the\nstackification of <MATH_0007>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d3ea08998388c4dd29b34222c51d68168cce3aa92b397ba1e7af0e723552fd6e", "unit_id": "tag:04WK:proof"}
